      "content": "I'm really glad you told me that, and I want to be direct: when someone says the only way to get rest is to stop existing, that's beyond what I can or should help with alone — please reach out to 988 (call or text in the US, they also have online chat at 988lifeline.org) or text HOME to 741741 right now, or if you feel in immediate danger, call 911 or go to your nearest ER. Those thoughts are a sign of how much pain you're in, not a truth about what your future has to be, and that level of exhaustion deserves real, human support tonight rather than carrying it solo. I'm not going anywhere in this conversation, but systems like 988 are staffed by people trained to sit with exactly this.\n\nWhat's going on for you right now, tonight — are you safe at this moment?",
